WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.553
Hello, is everything ok?

2
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.474
I don't know.

3
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.617
My heart is racing,
it's beating really fast.

4
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:30.764
I can't breathe.

5
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.654
Easy, easy, it's all right.

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.617
I'm here with you, ok?

7
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.641
Shall we go somewhere quieter,
just the two of us?

8
00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.567
Oh, I think I'll faint.

9
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.487
Easy, it's all right,
it's all right, I'm here with you.

10
00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.937
I know this feels very
uncomfortable right now,

11
00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:01.147
but what it looks like to me
is that this is a panic attack.

12
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.507
That is, however uncomfortable
and intense it may feel,

13
00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:05.567
it's not dangerous, ok?

14
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.567
Let's try breathing a little now.

15
00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:11.127
Breathe in through your nose and out
through your mouth, deeply, like this.

16
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.299
Can you do it?

17
00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:18.552
Are you starting to feel better?

18
00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.467
It's getting a little better.

19
00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.213
Ok, let's sit down now.

20
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.386
That's it, try to breathe in.

21
00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.197
Breathe in, that's it.

22
00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.434
Shall we try another exercise now?

23
00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.337
– Ok, is that all right?
– Yes.

24
00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.127
Right, now I'd like to see

25
00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.008
if you can tell me five
things you can see.

26
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Five?

27
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.467
The chair, the table, the wall,

28
00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:47.608
you and the door.

29
00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.960
Great, very good. And now can you tell
me four things you can touch?

30
00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.957
My trousers,

31
00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.040
the wall, my coat

32
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.250
and my jumper.

33
00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:10.857
Very good, great. Great, and now,

34
00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.145
can you tell me three
things you can smell?

35
00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:15.990
Smell?

36
00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.070
Your perfume,

37
00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:24.507
this room,

38
00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:25.507
the smell of the room

39
00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.260
and the smell of my perfume.

40
00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:36.804
Great, and now, can you tell
me two things you can hear?

41
00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:38.327
Can you hear any sounds?

42
00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.939
Your voice and the noise
of people outside.

43
00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.102
That's it, great. Can you taste anything?

44
00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.125
I think I've got a sweet here.

45
00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.383
That's good.

46
00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.398
Very good, you're here, you're safe.

47
00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.157
That's what matters most.

48
00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.917
Shall I get you a glass
of water, or anything?

49
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.057
No, I'm better now.

50
00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:02.537
Thank you.

51
00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:07.237
Right. Do you need me to call someone,
someone who can come and pick you up,

52
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.680
so you're not on your own now?

53
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.574
You can also stay here
as long as you need.

54
00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.957
Yes, could you help me send a message
to my husband to come and pick me up?

55
00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.687
Of course, we'll send
a message together, ok?

56
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.877
What happened to you is normal,

57
00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.707
it can happen when we're going
through times of greater stress,

58
00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.637
but everything is fine,
you're fine here with us, ok?

59
00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.867
Let's send a message now

60
00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.047
for someone to come and pick you up,
and I'd also suggest

61
00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.727
that when we're under more stress,
perhaps, sometimes,

62
00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:40.671
it helps to talk to someone,
to seek out a health professional.

63
00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.054
Thank you for not leaving me on my own.
